theorem isSelfDualC_topL : IsSelfDualC (pLine D) (topL D) :=
  GlobalTheory.LocMod.IntFrameStd.isSelfDualC_of_gram_one pLine_gram_eq_one _ mem_topL_iff

variable {T : Type} {L : LevCh D T} {sc : Consts}

/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Prove the components needed by the constructor for the conclusion.

Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Supply the required witnesses or components. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Supply the required witnesses or components.
